  "gap": 0.05,
  "hook": {
    "lines": [
      "This car just drove…",
      "*sideways*."
    ],
    "clip": "e_crab_front",
    "annotate": [
      {
        "type": "arrow",
        "at": 0,
        "x": 0.5,
        "y": 0.55,
        "angle": 30
      }
    ],
    "sfx": [
      {
        "id": "boom",
        "at": "word:sideways"
      }
    ]
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "lines": [
        "No drifting. All four wheels",
        "turned *90 degrees*."
      ],
      "clip": "e_wheel90",
      "punch": true
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "It's Hyundai Mobis's",
        "*e-Corner* system."
      ],
      "clip": "e_hq"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Every wheel gets its own motor,",
        "brakes, steering and suspension."
      ],
      "clip": "e_cutaway",
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "click",
          "at": "word:motor"
        },
        {
          "id": "click",
          "at": "word:brakes"
        },
        {
          "id": "click",
          "at": "word:steering"
        },
        {
          "id": "click",
          "at": "word:suspension"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "No steering rack. No driveshafts.",
        "Each wheel works *alone*."
      ],
      "clip": "e_city"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "So it can slide straight into",
        "a tight parking spot…"
      ],
      "clip": "e_park_top"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "…spin in place like a *tank*…"
      ],
      "clip": "e_zero",
      "punch": true,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "wow",
          "at": "end",
          "gain": -4
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "…or pivot around",
        "a single wheel."
      ],
      "clip": "e_pivot"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "In 2023, it became the first car like this",
        "to drive on *public roads*."
      ],
      "clip": "e_road"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "But here's the *twist*…"
      ],
      "clip": "e_drone",
      "pause_after": 0.3,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "dun_dun",
          "at": "start",
          "gain": -5,
          "dur": 2.2
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "You still can't *buy* it."
      ],
      "clip": "e_parked",
      "punch": true,
      "sfx": [
        {
          "id": "boom",
          "at": "word:buy"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Mobis says it's ready for mass production…",
        "but no car on sale uses it yet."
      ],
      "clip": "e_diag"
    },
    {
      "lines": [
        "Would *you* drive a car",
        "that walks like a crab? 🦀"
      ],
      "clip": "e_crab_front2"
    }
  ],
